<title>USA: Strouds January same-store sales down.</title>
<headline>Strouds January same-store sales down.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc Thursday reported net sales of $17.1 million for the four weeks ended February 1, compared with $15.8 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Comparable store sales decreased 2.4 percent.</p>
<p>Net sales for the 48 weeks ended February 1 were $195.5 million, compared with $173.3 million for the same period last year. Year-to-date comparable store sales increased 0.9 percent.</p>
</text>
